      "id": "claim_631eb085b69841628b4566960390ee23",
      "statement": "GameProject models game.project as an ordered line list and rewrites it losslessly: comments, blank lines, key order, section order and the file's original newline convention (CRLF or LF) all survive every edit, with lines joined using the newline convention detected at load time.",
