      "id": "claim_90a049e6de3048bcaaf0754e1340a865",
      "statement": "set() enforces Defold's compiled-path convention by auto-appending 'c' to the values of exactly the six COMPILED_SETTING_KEYS (matched section-qualified as 'section.key') when the value does not already end with 'c', making the operation idempotent; all other keys are written verbatim.",
