    {
      "id": "claim_2b5124801a60471bb032d8dd09b0d4ee",
      "statement": "Dependencies are read numerically ordered by the index after '#' (dependencies#2 before dependencies#10) with the legacy comma-separated 'dependencies' key used only when no indexed keys exist, and add_dependency/remove_dependency rewrite the whole block as gap-free sequential dependencies#0..#N-1 keys while leaving unrelated sections, comments and blank lines untouched.",
